{"id": "86016", "name": "אינטגרל מסוים של פולינום tⁿ+a·t (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Evaluate the following definite integral:</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int^{{CT:0}}_{{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}\\,d{{CT:3}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Find an antiderivative \\(F\\) of the integrand, then substitute the limits: the integral is \\(F(\\text{upper})-F(\\text{lower})\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The Newton–Leibniz formula</b><br>If <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int f(x)\\, dx = F(x)+c \\]</p> then <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int^a_b f(x)\\, dx = F(a) - F(b). \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — An antiderivative</b><br>So, in order to calculate the definite integral of {{CT:4}} with respect to {{CT:5}} we first calculate its integral:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:2}}\\, d{{CT:3}} = {{CT:6}}+c. \\]</p>So, let<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F({{CT:3}}) = {{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Substituting the limits</b><br>Then,<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int^{{CT:0}}_{{CT:1}} {{CT:2}}\\, d{{CT:3}} &= F({{CT:0}}) - F({{CT:1}}) \\\\ &= {{CT:7}} - \\left({{CT:8}}\\right) \\\\ &= {{CT:9}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "int(p,v,rdm2,rdm3)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-int(p,v,rdm2,rdm3)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is the negative of that expected. Have you got the limits the wrong way round?</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "q", "rdm1", "rdm2", "rdm3", "rdm4", "v"], "nvariants": 50}